### Test User Profile API Endpoints

### 1. View User Profile
GET https://localhost:5001/api/UserProfile/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Edit User Profile
PUT https://localhost:5001/api/UserProfile/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "email": "nguyenvana@example.com",
  "phone": "+84901234567",
  "address": "123 Le Loi, District 1, Ho Chi Minh City",
  "experienceLevel": "Intermediate",
  "preferredLanguage": "vi",
  "notificationPreferences": "email,push"
}

###

### 3. Upload Avatar (Note: Use Postman or Swagger for file upload)
### This is a multipart/form-data request
POST https://localhost:5001/api/UserProfile/1/avatar
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="avatar.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./avatar.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cropX"

10
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cropY"

10
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cropWidth"

80
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cropHeight"

80
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### 4. Delete Avatar
DELETE https://localhost:5001/api/UserProfile/1/avatar
Accept: application/json

###

### Test Validation - Missing Required Field
PUT https://localhost:5001/api/UserProfile/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "",
  "email": "invalid-email"
}

###

### Test Validation - Invalid Experience Level
PUT https://localhost:5001/api/UserProfile/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "experienceLevel": "Master"
}

